<title>CHINA: China's June oil products imports detailed.</title>
<headline>China's June oil products imports detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows oil product import figures as well as the country of origin in Jan-June.</p>
<p>Details were provided by the General Administration of Customs of China.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes. Percentages represent the share of</p>
<p>the total market. Percentages may not add up to 100 percent</p>
<p>because details of some smaller import origins have not been</p>
<p>included.</p>
<p>------Gasoline</p>
<p>   June imports: 15,983     Jan-June total imports: 43,481</p>
<p> ORIGIN	   June     Pct	Jan-June   Pct</p>
<p>  Singapore    14,461    90.5	32,047     73.7</p>
<p>  Saudi Arabia  1,522     9.5	11,433     26.3</p>
<p>------Light Diesel Fuel</p>
<p>   June imports: 875,461     Jan-June total imports: 4,239,715</p>
<p> ORIGIN	   June     Pct	Jan-June   Pct</p>
<p>  Singapore    440,493   50.3   2,207,926     52.1</p>
<p>  South Korea  270,145   30.9   1,169,609     27.6</p>
<p>  Russia	  70,232    8.0     219,777	5.2</p>
<p>------Heavy Diesel Fuel</p>
<p>   June imports:   9,011     Jan-June total imports:  47,249</p>
<p> ORIGIN	   June     Pct	Jan-June   Pct</p>
<p> Singapore	7,505    83.3	7,568     16</p>
<p>------Liquefied natural gas</p>
<p>   June imports:  7,147     Jan-June total imports: 92,738</p>
<p> ORIGIN	   June     Pct	Jan-June   Pct</p>
<p>  South Korea    5,956    83.3     10,965     11.8</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
